Research attribution
--------------------
The exact piecewise-linear transport baseline is an independently written
specialization of the procedure described in Section 4.1 of:

Jiří Kupka and Nicole Škorupová (2021),
"On PSO-Based Simulations of Fuzzy Dynamical Systems Induced by
One-Dimensional Ones", Mathematics 9(21), 2737.
https://doi.org/10.3390/math9212737

The implementation uses exact rational arithmetic, transports pieces through
map branches and combines colliding membership contributions by pointwise
maximum. Attribution acknowledges the published algorithm; it does not claim
that this project originated it. The baseline is a qualified specialization,
not a reproduction of the paper's complete PSO optimization or experiments.
No third-party implementation or article PDF is included in this project.
See docs/COMPARISON_METHOD.md and the source register for scope and access.

